The application contains seeded sample meetings so the workspace is immediately usable.

The sample data includes:

- Meeting titles
- Dates
- Participants
- Transcripts
- Summaries
- Topics
- Decisions
- Action items

This allows the application's core workflows to be demonstrated immediately after setup.

